    "/internal/payment-intents/activate-by-command": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "activatePaymentIntentByCommand",
        "x-implementation-status": "http-implemented-production-unwired",
        "description": "Confirm effective settlement eligibility for the original caller/create-command/saga. Fresh and replayed acceptance return 200 with the same shape. A later durable cancellation fence returns coded 409 even for a previously accepted activation. Unknown or mismatched provisioning returns uncoded 409 and requires reconciliation, not cancellation. Activation has no charging effect. Reuse a distinct stable key/body; C rejects key reuse across kinds/targets.",
